      "en_US": [
        "If you throw food at Pokémon, it\n",
        "makes them easier to catch...\r",
        "But they’re also more likely to\n",
        "bolt when they eat.\r",
        "If you throw mud at them, they\n",
        "also get easier to catch...\r",
        "But they also get more likely to\n",
        "bolt out of anger.\r",
        "It’s hard to decide what I should\n",
        "be doing."
      ]
